  "Q10294_SevenSignsToTheMonasteryOfSilence/32787-01.html": {
   "file": "Q10294_SevenSignsToTheMonasteryOfSilence/32787-01.html",
   "quest": 10294,
   "text": "Abyssal Saintess Elcadia: Somewhere around here should be an office for Eris, the Abbot of the Monastery of Silence. Rumor has it that the Monastery's library is connected through the Abbot's Room. We should find the Abbot's Room first.",
   "header": "Abyssal Saintess Elcadia",
   "when": [
    "cond 1"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q10294_SevenSignsToTheMonasteryOfSilence/32787-02.html": {
   "file": "Q10294_SevenSignsToTheMonasteryOfSilence/32787-02.html",
   "quest": 10294,
   "text": "Abyssal Saintess Elcadia: Let's find Eris and try to articulate our purpose.",
   "header": "Abyssal Saintess Elcadia",
   "when": [
    "cond 2"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q10295_SevenSignsSolinasTomb/32787-01.html": {
   "file": "Q10295_SevenSignsSolinasTomb/32787-01.html",
   "quest": 10295,
   "text": "Abyssal Saintess Elcadia: I think Eris wanted to tell us more. Let's go back and find her.",
   "header": "Abyssal Saintess Elcadia",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; memoState < 1"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q10295_SevenSignsSolinasTomb/32787-02.html": {
   "file": "Q10295_SevenSignsSolinasTomb/32787-02.html",
   "quest": 10295,
   "text": "Abyssal Saintess Elcadia: Hmm... The seal of Saintess... Is there no other way to approach to the truth of Embryo? Let's listen carefully what Eris is saying.",
   "header": "Abyssal Saintess Elcadia",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; memo 1; !memoState < 1"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q10295_SevenSignsSolinasTomb/32787-03.html": {
   "file": "Q10295_SevenSignsSolinasTomb/32787-03.html",
   "quest": 10295,
   "text": "Abyssal Saintess Elcadia: Well, the devices in this room have been removed. Let's go back to the central Gatemaster and see if we can go to Solina's casket room.",
   "header": "Abyssal Saintess Elcadia",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; memo 2; !memoState < 1"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q10295_SevenSignsSolinasTomb/32787-04.html": {
   "file": "Q10295_SevenSignsSolinasTomb/32787-04.html",
   "quest": 10295,
   "text": "Abyssal Saintess Elcadia: We must find Solina's true casket. A Saintess such as Solina wouldn't be buried in this vanity drenched grave. If we find her real casket room, we also find the information for Embryo we seek.",
   "header": "Abyssal Saintess Elcadia",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; memo 3; !memoState < 1"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q10295_SevenSignsSolinasTomb/32787-05.html": {
   "file": "Q10295_SevenSignsSolinasTomb/32787-05.html",
   "quest": 10295,
   "text": "Abyssal Saintess Elcadia: It seems like Solina's old story ends here. Such is life.",
   "header": "Abyssal Saintess Elcadia",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; memo 4; !memoState < 1"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Okay. I will go back to Solina's casket room.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest MonasteryOfSilence1 SOLINAS_RESTING_PLACE",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "MonasteryOfSilence1",
     "event": "SOLINAS_RESTING_PLACE"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q10296_SevenSignsOneWhoSeeksThePowerOfTheSeal/32787-01.html": {
   "file": "Q10296_SevenSignsOneWhoSeeksThePowerOfTheSeal/32787-01.html",
   "quest": 10296,
   "text": "Abyssal Saintess Elcadia: Somewhere around here there should be an office for Eris, Abbot of the Monastery of Silence. I've heard the Monastery's library connects through the Abbot's Room. Let's go find the Abbot's Room.",
   "header": "Abyssal Saintess Elcadia",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; memoState < 1"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q10296_SevenSignsOneWhoSeeksThePowerOfTheSeal/32787-02.html": {
   "file": "Q10296_SevenSignsOneWhoSeeksThePowerOfTheSeal/32787-02.html",
   "quest": 10296,
   "text": "Abyssal Saintess Elcadia: It appears there's still something Eris needs to tell us. Let's hear her story.",
   "header": "Abyssal Saintess Elcadia",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; !memoState < 1; memoState < 2"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q10296_SevenSignsOneWhoSeeksThePowerOfTheSeal/32787-03.html": {
   "file": "Q10296_SevenSignsOneWhoSeeksThePowerOfTheSeal/32787-03.html",
   "quest": 10296,
   "text": "Abyssal Saintess Elcadia: That guy a little while ago... I sense he is somehow related to Embryo. Come, let's stop him.",
   "header": "Abyssal Saintess Elcadia",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; memo 2; !memoState < 1; !memoState < 2"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q10296_SevenSignsOneWhoSeeksThePowerOfTheSeal/32787-04.html": {
   "file": "Q10296_SevenSignsOneWhoSeeksThePowerOfTheSeal/32787-04.html",
   "quest": 10296,
   "text": "Abyssal Saintess Elcadia: That guy... He is named Etis van Etina. Interesting... That isn't his true form, this is some kind of mirror thought form... The real form of Embryo would be too much for us alone. Let's finish here and get out of this place. We'll return to my home, discuss what we should…",
   "header": "Abyssal Saintess Elcadia",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; !memoState < 1; !memoState < 2"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Let's get out of this place.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest MonasteryOfSilence1 EXIT",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "MonasteryOfSilence1",
     "event": "EXIT"
    }
   ]
  },
